                "prompt": "Open `structures/bst.c`. Implement `bst_build_balanced` from a sorted array and `bst_rebalance` for an arbitrary BST. The required approach is linear: inorder traversal writes the keys in sorted order, and midpoint recursion rebuilds a tree whose left and right subtree sizes differ by at most one at every node.",
