            "title": "Applications of Python",
            "bodyMarkdown": "Python is used in many fields, including:\n\n- Web development\n- Data science\n- Machine learning\n- Automation\n\nAt the beginner level, you do not need extra packages or files to start. You can begin with small programs that print clear messages:\n\n```python\nprint('Python can help automate repeated work')\nprint('Python can help analyze data later')\n```\n\nThese lines ask Python to display two messages. Later courses can add files, packages, and larger projects. For now, focus on reading each line and predicting exactly what appears in the output."
